      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>Seemingly carved from a dark gray stone, this sinister crouching humanoid resembles a horned, winged demon.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 18, touch 12; flat-footed 16 (+2 dex, +6 natural)</p><p>hp 57 [84] (6d10+24)</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +7, Will +6</p><p>DR 10/magic; Resist Earth 15; Strong Lightning</p><p>Weakness Wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft., Fly 60 ft. (average)</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +9 (1d6+3), Bite +9 (1d6+3), Gore +9 (1d6+3)</p><p>Special Attacks Bloody Claw</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 17, Dex 15, Con 19, Int 8, Wis 12, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +9; CMD 21</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Skill Focus (Fly)</p><p>Skills Fly +14, Perception +10, Stealth +10 (+16 in stony areas); Racial Modifiers +2 Stealth (+6 in stony environments)</p><p>Languages Common, Terran</p><p>SQ Freeze</p>"
